\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-315\li315\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .  Truly, the grace of  The Almighty God
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Has made us to live till now;
\par However hard life on this earth shall be
\par He delive'd us from all ill.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Whatever good work we do
\par Our help comes from our God;
\par So we'll  sing Ebenezer to proclaim
\par How helpful God has been to us.
\par \i 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Ebenezer! Yes! God has helped us thus far
\par Ebenezer! Yes! O, God it's by Thy grace!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.  In trouble or in joy;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 His love doth cover us all
\par Our love, our faith, our prayer
\par Must in this journey be our guide.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par So let's with one accord,
\par Keep worshiping God in Joy;
\par That even so in death,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj We shall all wear the crown with Christ.
\par 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Ebenezer! Yes! God has helped us thus far
\par Ebenezer! Yes! O, God it's by Thy grace!\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

